  <section class="section roles"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">Three connected perspectives</div><h2>Everyone gets the right tools.</h2><p class="lead">The same marketplace data moves through dedicated administration, seller, and buyer experiences.</p><div class="role-flow">
    <div class="role"><span class="role-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><path d="M12 3 L19 6 V11 C19 16 15.5 19.5 12 21 C8.5 19.5 5 16 5 11 V6 Z"/></svg></span><strong>Administrator</strong><ul><li>Configure modules and settings</li><li>Moderate users and listings</li><li>Manage payments and subscriptions</li><li>Review reports and activity</li></ul></div>
    <div class="role"><span class="role-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><path d="M3 8 L12 4 L21 8 L12 12 Z"/><path d="M3 8 V16 L12 20 L21 16 V8"/><line x1="12" y1="12" x2="12" y2="20"/></svg></span><strong>Seller</strong><ul><li>Create vertical-aware listings</li><li>Handle orders and customer actions</li><li>Track inventory and performance</li><li>Manage wallet and withdrawals</li></ul></div>
    <div class="role"><span class="role-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><path d="M6 8h12l-1 12H7z"/><path d="M9 8V6a3 3 0 0 1 6 0v2"/></svg></span><strong>Buyer</strong><ul><li>Discover and save listings</li><li>Chat with marketplace sellers</li><li>Buy, book, apply, or inquire</li><li>Track account activity</li></ul></div>
    <div class="role role-connect"><span class="role-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><circle cx="6" cy="6" r="3"/><circle cx="18" cy="6" r="3"/><circle cx="12" cy="18" r="3"/><line x1="6" y1="9" x2="12" y2="15"/><line x1="18" y1="9" x2="12" y2="15"/><line x1="9" y1="6" x2="15" y2="6"/></svg></span><strong>Connected by design</strong><p>Every role reads and writes the same live data&mdash;no exports, no delays, no gaps between teams.</p></div>
  </div></div></section>
